.IX Title "AWS::SecureMediaDelivery::Token 3"
.TH AWS::SecureMediaDelivery::Token 3 "2025-11-03" "perl v5.34.1" "User Contributed Perl Documentation"
.\" For nroff, turn off justification.  Always turn off hyphenation; it makes
.\" way too many mistakes in technical documents.
.if n .ad l
.nh
.SH "NAME"
AWS::SecureMediaDelivery::Token \- Generates JWT tokens with various security policies
.SH "SYNOPSIS"
.IX Header "SYNOPSIS"
.Vb 2
\&    use AWS::SecureMediaDelivery::Token;
\&    use AWS::SecureMediaDelivery::Secret;
\&    
\&    my $secret = AWS::SecureMediaDelivery::Secret\->new(
\&        stack_name => \*(AqMyStack\*(Aq,
\&        ttl        => 300,
\&    );
\&    
\&    my $token = AWS::SecureMediaDelivery::Token\->new(secret => $secret);
\&    
\&    my $viewer_attributes = {
\&        ip      => \*(Aq192.168.1.1\*(Aq,
\&        co      => \*(AqUS\*(Aq,
\&        headers => {
\&            \*(Aquser\-agent\*(Aq => \*(AqMozilla/5.0...\*(Aq,
\&            \*(Aqreferer\*(Aq    => \*(Aqhttps://example.com\*(Aq,
\&        },
\&    };
\&    
\&    my $token_policy = {
\&        ip      => 1,
\&        co      => 1,
\&        headers => [\*(Aquser\-agent\*(Aq, \*(Aqreferer\*(Aq],
\&        paths   => [\*(Aq/video/\*(Aq],
\&        exp     => \*(Aq+2h\*(Aq,
\&    };
\&    
\&    my $signed_url = $token\->generate(
\&        $viewer_attributes,
\&        \*(Aqhttps://example.cloudfront.net/video/stream.m3u8\*(Aq,
\&        $token_policy
\&    );
.Ve
.SH "DESCRIPTION"
.IX Header "DESCRIPTION"
This class creates secure tokens for media delivery with support for
\&\s-1IP\s0 validation, geolocation, headers, query strings, and session management.
.SH "METHODS"
.IX Header "METHODS"
.SS "new(%args)"
.IX Subsection "new(%args)"
Creates a new Token generator.
.IP "\(bu" 4
secret \- AWS::SecureMediaDelivery::Secret instance (required)
.IP "\(bu" 4
default_token_policy \- Default policy for token generation (optional)
.ie n .SS "generate($viewer_attributes, $playback_url, $token_policy, $secret_alias)"
.el .SS "generate($viewer_attributes, \f(CW$playback_url\fP, \f(CW$token_policy\fP, \f(CW$secret_alias\fP)"
.IX Subsection "generate($viewer_attributes, $playback_url, $token_policy, $secret_alias)"
Generate a secure \s-1JWT\s0 token.
.PP
.Vb 6
\&    my $signed_url = $token\->generate(
\&        $viewer_attributes,  # HashRef of viewer attributes
\&        $playback_url,       # String (optional)
\&        $token_policy,       # HashRef of token policy
\&        $secret_alias        # String (optional, default: \*(Aqprimary\*(Aq)
\&    );
.Ve
.SS "set_debug($debug)"
.IX Subsection "set_debug($debug)"
Enable or disable debug logging.
.PP
.Vb 1
\&    $token\->set_debug(1);
.Ve
.SH "SEE ALSO"
.IX Header "SEE ALSO"
AWS::SecureMediaDelivery::Secret, AWS::SecureMediaDelivery::Session
